    "Rewrite": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改写"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改寫"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réécrire"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リライト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rewrite this text in a polished, professional, and formal tone. Keep the original meaning, language, and formatting; replace slang, contractions, and casual phrasing with formal equivalents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用更得体、专业、正式的语气改写这段文本。保持原意、语言和格式；将俚语、缩写和随意措辞替换为正式表达"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以得體、專業且正式的語氣改寫這段文字。保持原意、語言與格式；將俚語、縮寫和隨意措辭替換為正式表達"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réécrire ce texte dans un ton soigné, professionnel et formel. Conserver le sens, la langue et la mise en forme d’origine ; remplacer l’argot, les contractions et les tournures familières par des équivalents formels"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "洗練されたプロフェッショナルでフォーマルなトーンにこのテキストを書き直します。元の意味、言語、書式を保持し、スラング、短縮形、カジュアルな表現をフォーマルな表現に置き換えてください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rewrite to improve clarity, flow, and word choice while keeping the original meaning, tone, language, and formatting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在保持原意、语气、语言和格式的前提下改写，提升清晰度、流畅度和用词"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在維持原意、語氣、語言與格式的前提下改寫，提升清晰度、流暢度與用詞"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réécrire pour améliorer la clarté, la fluidité et le choix des mots tout en conservant le sens, le ton, la langue et la mise en forme d’origine"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "元の意味、トーン、言語、書式を保ちながら、明瞭さ、文章の流れ、語彙の選択を改善するように書き直します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
